<newsitem itemid="141475" id="root" date="1996-10-24" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Merrill sets warrants on CS Holding.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on CS Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it has issued three million American-style put warrants, on CS Holding shares.</p>
<p>Two warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    120 CHF		   PREMIUM	12.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.60 CHF		  GEARING	13.80 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 11.NOV.96-19.DEC.97   PAYDATE	06.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING APPLIED-SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  127 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
